// Added to a specific enemy by JuggernautSkillData.Discharge (DischargeCooldownPerEnemy) - keeps
// that exact enemy immune to being knocked back again by another discharge until it expires, ticked
// down and removed by JuggernautDischargeCooldownSystem regardless of whether Brutus is still nearby
// or even still using the skill. Lives on the enemy, not on Brutus - a single discharge can hit many
// enemies at once, each starting its own independent cooldown.
component JuggernautDischargeCooldown
{
    FP Remaining;
}
